# "Whenever you cast a spell of the chosen type" (CR 603.2): Bot2's own Llanowar Elves, cast on turn 2, puts no counter on Bot1's
# Door of Destinies (Elf is chosen), and Bot2's Elf is no bigger than 1/1 - the bonus is for creatures *you control*. Bot1's
# Mystic on turn 1 had made one counter (a 2/2); the Llanowar Elves it casts on turn 3 make the second, so both Elves are 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Door of Destinies
Elvish Mystic
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x12

